      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID31",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "Thank you",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<h3>Thank you.</h3><p>Your report has been recorded. The information you shared helps build a clearer picture of how AI systems can affect people's mental health. You may now close this window.</p>",
